            "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are wielding a ranged weapon with the volley trait and reload 0.</p><hr /><p>You fire a volley at all foes in an area. Make one Strike with a –2 penalty against each enemy within a @Template[burst|distance:10] centered at or beyond your weapon's volley range. Roll the damage only once for all targets.</p>\n<p>Each attack counts toward your multiple attack penalty, but do not increase your penalty until you have made all your attacks.</p>"
